      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مَزَّاجٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمَزِّجٌ</span></b> ; <i>A man who continues
